    "Shared groups, package receipts and external helpers are not removed. Custom locations and other accounts are not searched. Process checks cover the current account. Missing associations are not added to the plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shared groups, package receipts and external helpers are not removed. Custom locations and other accounts are not searched. Process checks cover the current account. Missing associations are not added to the plan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留共享组容器、安装包收据和外部辅助程序。不搜索自定义位置或其他账户；进程检查覆盖当前账户。不存在的关联项目不会加入计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
